Subject: [PATCH 3/5] stack_env: architect_critic serving env =
 GGML_FUSED_DECODE_OFF=1 (DAR-LAT-3h v2, PROPOSED)

Applies on every G1 outcome except INVALID-PREMISE and INCONCLUSIVE. It
equals master recipe.env (research cbaeee2d). The knob is inert while MTP
serves. GGML_NOHUGEPAGE_PROCESS (its own G1 factor) and GGML_FA_SPLIT_KV
(task DAR-LAT-3i) are NOT set.

- test_stack_env_recipe_parity.py composes the env as start_server does,
  strip included. Every recipe.env knob must be emitted, and no
  recipe.env_not_serving knob may be.
- test_launch_env_strip_preserve.py: architect_critic joins
  DELIBERATE_GGML_BLOCKS, the visible act that ends the landing's
  quiet-correction guarantee for this one role. Every other role still must
  declare nothing.
- Derived lean/descriptors/priors/summary regenerated by
  `stack_change_pipeline.py update --research-registry <research v2 base>`.
  Phase 7 re-runs update against the merged research main.

Unsigned. Part of the DAR-LAT-3h stack-change package
